{"author":["Elastic"],"building_block_type":"default","description":"检测构建块：修改Azure虚拟机配置。对应需求：持久化。官方：Azure Virtual Machine Configuration Modified。","false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"from":"now-9m","index":["logs-azure.activitylogs-*"],"language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】构建块：修改Azure虚拟机配置","references":["https://blog.pwnedlabs.io/diving-deep-into-azure-vm-attack-vectors","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/virtual-machines/user-data"],"risk_score":21,"rule_id":"56fa718c-a0de-4492-97ff-bbc444b015b8","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: 跨平台","主题: 持久化","来源: 默认","对应需求: 持久化"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"query","query":"data_stream.dataset:azure.activitylogs and\n    event.action:\"MICROSOFT.COMPUTE/VIRTUALMACHINES/WRITE\" and\n    event.outcome:(success or Success)\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1037","name":"Boot or Logon Initialization Scripts","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1037/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0003","name":"Persistence","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0003/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1651","name":"Cloud Administration Command","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1651/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}}],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"azure","version":"*"}],"note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n构建块：修改Azure虚拟机配置\n\n### 为何重要\n在重启或登录后保持立足点\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 按规则数据源接入对应日志（终端、云、身份或网络）。\n2. 构建块规则用于关联，确认数据流有数据后再评估。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","cloud.account.id","process.name","process.command_line","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","event.action","message"]},"version":2,"immutable":true,"r